# Every authenticated identity: its own devices/<id>/ tree and the benchmark
# topics; the operator reads $SYS. urMQTT's ACL is stricter (PERFORMANCE.md).
# "pattern" lines apply to all users ("topic" lines before a "user" line would
# apply to anonymous clients only, and Mosquitto then drops publishes silently).
pattern readwrite devices/%u/#
pattern readwrite fleet/bench/#
user operator
topic read $SYS/#
